SUMMARY:Deadline: University of Groningen: Lecturer 4\, Arts\, Culture and 
 Media
DESCRIPTION:A one-year teaching appointment in the Faculty of Arts at the U
 niversity of Groningen\, covering courses across the BA in Arts\, Culture 
 and Media and the Popular Music and Sonic Cultures master's track. Teachin
 g spans audiovisual arts\, popular music and arts management at both under
 graduate and postgraduate level. This is a teaching-weighted post rather t
 han a research one\, so it suits practitioners who want a formal academic 
 foothold in audiovisual and sonic culture without committing to a research
  track. REQUIREMENTS: a research master's in an appropriate arts disciplin
 e\, undergraduate teaching experience\, and English at C1 (CEFR). PREFERRE
 D: a PhD in an appropriate arts discipline\, a BKO or UTQ teaching qualifi
 cation\, postgraduate teaching experience\, musicology expertise\, Dutch a
 t B2\, and familiarity with the Dutch higher education system. Apply throu
 gh the AcademicTransfer posting (vacancy ID V26.2320-EN). Closes 15 August
  2026\; appointment starts 1 September 2026.\n\nOrganisation: University o
 f Groningen\, Faculty of Arts\nLocation: Groningen\, Netherlands (Broerstr
 aat 5)\nAward: EUR 3\,706 to 5\,760 gross per month at 1.0 FTE (the post i
 s 0.8 FTE)\, plus standard Dutch university holiday and year-end allowance
 s.\nDuration: Temporary\, 12-month fixed-term appointment at 0.8 FTE\, sta
 rting 1 September 2026\n\nMore: https://www.academictransfer.com/en/jobs/3
 62915/lecturer-4-arts-culture-and-media/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrant
 desk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.academictransfer.com/en/jobs/362915/lecturer-4-arts-culture
 -and-media/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Groningen\, Netherlands (Broerstraat 5)
